title Full Project Discovery Flow

participant "Client" as Client
participant "DiscoveryPipeline" as Pipeline
participant "SignatureBuilder" as SigBuilder
participant "Cluster Detection" as Cluster
participant "Architecture Detectors" as ArchDetectors
participant "Confidence Evaluator" as Confidence
participant "LLM Client" as LLM
participant "ContractRegistry" as Contracts
participant "Output Generator" as Output

Client->Pipeline: executeDiscovery(projectRoot, parameters)
activate Pipeline

Pipeline->Pipeline: Extract parameters (useLlm, llmThreshold, llmMode)

note right of Pipeline: Step 1: Architecture Detection\nwith Cluster Detection

Pipeline->SigBuilder: SignatureBuilder(\n  projectRoot,\n  confidenceThreshold,\n  useLlmForLowConfidence,\n  llmClient\n)
activate SigBuilder

SigBuilder->ArchDetectors: BuildSystemDetector.detect()
ArchDetectors-->SigBuilder: BuildSystemResult

SigBuilder->ArchDetectors: ModulePatternDetector.detect()
ArchDetectors-->SigBuilder: ModulePatternResult

note right of SigBuilder: Step 2: Cluster Detection

SigBuilder->Cluster: detectBuildModules()
Cluster->Cluster: Check settings.gradle.kts
Cluster->Cluster: Check pom.xml

alt Build modules found
    Cluster-->SigBuilder: buildModules list
    SigBuilder->SigBuilder: Use build modules as clusters
else No build modules
    SigBuilder->Cluster: Scan directory structure
    Cluster->Cluster: Detect source directories
    Cluster->Cluster: Count source files
    Cluster-->SigBuilder: clusters from directory structure
end

note right of SigBuilder: Step 3: Per-Cluster Architecture Detection

loop For each cluster
    SigBuilder->ArchDetectors: FrameworkDetector.detect(modulePath)
    ArchDetectors-->SigBuilder: FrameworkResult
    
    SigBuilder->ArchDetectors: Detect design patterns
    ArchDetectors-->SigBuilder: DesignPatterns
    
    SigBuilder->ArchDetectors: Detect language features
    ArchDetectors-->SigBuilder: LanguageFeatures
    
    SigBuilder->Confidence: calculateModuleConfidence()
    Confidence-->SigBuilder: confidence score
    
    alt confidence >= threshold (0.7)
        SigBuilder->SigBuilder: Accept heuristic result
        SigBuilder->SigBuilder: Mark source as "heuristic"
    else confidence < threshold AND useLlmForLowConfidence = true
        SigBuilder->LLM: detectWithLLM(cluster, heuristic)
        activate LLM
        LLM->LLM: Analyze cluster structure
        LLM->LLM: Generate architecture analysis
        LLM-->SigBuilder: LLM result
        deactivate LLM
        SigBuilder->SigBuilder: Merge heuristic + LLM results
        SigBuilder->SigBuilder: Mark source as "heuristic+llm"
    else confidence < threshold AND LLM disabled
        SigBuilder->SigBuilder: Mark as low confidence
        SigBuilder->SigBuilder: Flag for review
        SigBuilder->SigBuilder: Mark source as "heuristic(low_confidence)"
    end
end

SigBuilder->SigBuilder: detectDeploymentPattern(clusters)
SigBuilder->SigBuilder: Derive deployment pattern from cluster analysis
note right of SigBuilder: Deployment pattern derived from:\n- cluster count\n- cluster independence\n- build module structure

SigBuilder->SigBuilder: detectBuildTools()
SigBuilder->SigBuilder: detectLibraries()

SigBuilder->SigBuilder: ArchitectureSignature(\n  buildSystem,\n  moduleFrameworks,\n  modulePatterns,\n  clusters,\n  moduleDesignPatterns,\n  moduleLanguageFeatures,\n  deploymentPattern,\n  confidence\n)
SigBuilder-->Pipeline: Complete signature
deactivate SigBuilder

Pipeline->Pipeline: Generate architecture-detection.yaml

note right of Pipeline: Step 4: Discovery Pipeline Execution

loop For each cluster
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Select cluster
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Load cluster configuration
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Execute discovery phases
    Pipeline->Contracts: Generate contracts
    Contracts-->Pipeline: Contract artifacts
end

Pipeline->Contracts: ContractRegistry(registry)
Contracts-->Pipeline: Registered contracts

note right of Pipeline: Step 5: Output Generation

Pipeline->Output: Generate output files
activate Output
Output->Output: architecture-detection.yaml
Output->Output: cluster-*.yaml
Output->Output: contracts.yaml
Output->Output: semantic-cache/
Output-->Pipeline: Output files
deactivate Output

Pipeline->Pipeline: Generate DiscoveryResult
Pipeline-->Client: DiscoveryResult.success()

deactivate Pipeline
